ZevaUI's token primitives and component recipes port numeric geometry
values (corner radii) and the resulting contrast ratios derived from
shadcn/ui's public component registry. No source code from shadcn/ui is
copied, vendored, or redistributed; only measured numeric values and the
design decisions they informed are referenced. See
`docs/adrs/0022-shadcn-visual-language-port.md` for the full record of what
was measured and why.
